border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"xxxmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Director of Nursing, Tawes Nursing &amp; Rehab Center</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"xxxmsonormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Job Description Status:</span></b></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"xxxmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">In progress, information for posting is below</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"xxxmsonormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class=\"xxxmsonormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Position Summary:</span></b></p><p class=\"xxxmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">The Infection Preventionist manages activities of the McCready Nursing Home Infection Prevention Program under guidelines established by the TidalHealth Infection Prevention Team, The Joint Commission, Department of Health and Mental Hygiene, the Center for Disease Control, APIC, SHEA, IHI, AHRQ and OSHA. The Infection Preventionist ’s scope of care is to protect the patient, healthcare worker, visitors and others in the healthcare environment in a cost-effective manner, whenever possible, in order to improve the health of the communities we serve. The inventory, distribution/delivery of medications may be required.</span></p><p class=\"xxxmsonormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class=\"xxxmsonormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Education:</span></b></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"xxxmsolistparagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">High School Diploma or GED required.</span></li><li class=\"xxxmsolistparagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Completion of a state-approved practical nursing program required.</span></li></ul><p class=\"xxxmsonormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class=\"xxxmsonormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">License and/or certification:</span></b></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"xxxmsonormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Licensed Practical Nurse (LPN), licensed in the state in which they live.</span></li><li class=\"xxxmsonormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Certification in Infection Prevention and Control by the National Certification Board of Infection Control and Epidemiology LLS (credentialed as “CIC”) is highly preferred.</span></li></ul><p class=\"xxxmsonormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class=\"xxxmsonormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Experience:</span></b></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"xxxmsonormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Five years’ experience as a Licensed Nurse Practitioner including one year of experience in an administrative, supervisory, consultative or teaching capacity.</span></li><li class=\"xxxmsonormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Experience with clinical diagnostic and laboratory procedures, microbiology, infectious/communicable diseases, patient care procedures and detailed knowledge of acute care hospital facility operations.</span></li><li class=\"xxxmsonormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Experience working with all components of Microsoft Office (Word, Access, Excel, Power point), HPF, Safety Surveillor, Care Manager, and Star.</span></li></ul><p class=\"xxxmsonormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class=\"xxxmsonormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Schedule:</span></b></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"xxxmsonormal\" style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; line-height:115%\">Primarily day shift, Monday through Friday.</span></li><li class=\"xxxmsonormal\" style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; line-height:115%\">Occasional weekends, evenings or nights as needed. </span></li></ul><p class=\"xxxmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"xxxmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Thanks,</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Erin Cowder, SHRM-CP</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Compensation Analyst</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Human Resources Department</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Tidal Health</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>tidalhealth.org</b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Have a question for HR?&nbsp; Send it to our Shared Services team.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><a href=\"https://apps.powerapps.com/play/e/default-ff279a42-1cb6-4542-b65a-95186f081fd8/a/7f4b8c55-c804-4afa-93c3-f7308ddcbdae?tenantId=ff279a42-1cb6-4542-b65a-95186f081fd8&amp;hint=384e5157-8ea1-4b5c-912b-4a3979a7f5f3&amp;source=sharebutton&amp;sourcetime=1769439969989\">HR Questions &amp; Answers</a></span><i></i></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p></div></body></html>","bodyType":"html"}